This repository includes or derives from:

- mods/t3-agents, t3-chrome, t3-focus, t3-pane, t3-new-menu — copied unchanged from
  herdr-t3 by JinJieBeWater (https://github.com/JinJieBeWater/herdr-t3), Apache-2.0.
- mods/onyx-tabs, mods/onyx-spaces — modified from herdr-t3's t3-tabs and t3-spaces
  (Apache-2.0). Changes: icon-only toolbar with side-panel, pull-request and Insights
  buttons; per-tab working timer; branch always shown with an icon in the spaces list.
- herdr-t3 itself starts from Herdr App's shipped mods and layout (Apache-2.0).
- mods/onyx-status/branch.svg — Herdr App's shipped workspace-chrome icon (Apache-2.0).

Not included, fetched by install.sh from their authors' repositories at install time:
issues (jankeesvw/herdr-issues), lazygit-panel (o101k/herdr-lazygit),
git-changes (aBER0724/herdr-git-changes), insights (GaganSD/coding-agent-toolkit),
gh-prs (mrolafsson/herdr-github). Their own licenses apply.

onyx-quota reads quota through quota-axi (https://github.com/kunchenguid/quota-axi),
installed separately. Provider icons are Herdr's own shipped icons, not bundled here.
